# Drover Grizzly: "Whenever this creature attacks while saddled, creatures you control gain trample until end of turn" (CR 702.171b, 702.19, 611.2c).
# Turn 1: a Black Lotus casts the Grizzly ({2}{G}), then Memnite and (with a Mox Sapphire) Aegis Turtle come down. Bot2 casts its own Memnite.
# Turn 3: Saddle 1 (CR 702.171a) taps other creatures with total power 1 or more: Aegis Turtle (power 0) is refused, Memnite saddles the Grizzly. The Grizzly attacks, the trigger
# resolves, and every creature Bot1 controls (the tapped Memnite and the Turtle included) gains trample; Bot2's Memnite does not. After end of turn nobody has trample.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Drover Grizzly
Memnite
Mox Sapphire
Aegis Turtle
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

